<title>SPAIN: Spain's Repsol approves 181 pta dividend.</title>
<headline>Spain's Repsol approves 181 pta dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-03-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Spanish energy group Repsol said on Monday it had approved a total 181 peseta gross dividend per share against 1996 results.</p>
<p>The interim dividend is 79 pesetas and the final dividend is 102 pesetas. The total dividend will be paid pending approval by the annual shareholders meeting set for June 6.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom +341 585 2160</p>
</text>
